# Game balance (code-first)

**Runtime and `npm run build`** use committed game data only:

- [`src/game/structureBalanceData.ts`](../src/game/structureBalanceData.ts) — structure costs, build times, passive `/hr` effects
- [`src/game/researchData.ts`](../src/game/researchData.ts) — research costs, `costScale`, effects
- [`src/game/jobHubData.ts`](../src/game/jobHubData.ts) — Job Hub T1/T2 postings

Edit these files directly when tuning economy. Regenerate metrics: `node scripts/balance-report.mjs` → `docs/balance-report.md`.

## Optional reference workbook

[`Corp Idle Working.xlsx`](../Corp%20Idle%20Working.xlsx) (tabs: **Structure cost and rate**, **Research Cost**, **Research**, **Job Hub**) is a design reference—not read by the game build.

Bulk copy reference → code (dev only):

```bash
node scripts/import-balance-from-workbook.mjs
```

Legacy per-domain scripts (also optional): `build-structure-balance.mjs`, `build-research-data.mjs`, `build-job-data.mjs`.

Do not commit service account JSON or require a workbook for CI.
